1
00:00:00,000 --> 00:00:06,000
From an idea. To a space.

2
00:00:06,000 --> 00:00:15,000
Bring your context. A real venue. A clear intent. Your brand.

3
00:00:15,000 --> 00:00:23,000
One workspace. From brief to concept shot.

4
00:00:23,000 --> 00:00:31,000
Keep the drawing, brief and brand together.

5
00:00:31,000 --> 00:00:38,000
Tell Muse what the space needs to do.

6
00:00:38,000 --> 00:00:45,000
Give the design a point of view.

7
00:00:45,000 --> 00:00:50,000
Describe the space you have in mind.

8
00:00:50,000 --> 00:01:02,000
Watch the design take shape.

9
00:01:02,000 --> 00:01:14,000
Real furniture. Editable placements.

10
00:01:14,000 --> 00:01:18,000
Review the proposal before applying it.

11
00:01:18,000 --> 00:01:22,000
Your design stays yours to edit.

12
00:01:22,000 --> 00:01:32,000
See how the space comes together.

13
00:01:32,000 --> 00:01:39,000
A small request. A precise change.

14
00:01:39,000 --> 00:01:48,000
Refine the color. Improve the seating.

15
00:01:48,000 --> 00:01:56,000
Now, find the shot that tells the story.

16
00:01:56,000 --> 00:02:05,000
Muse frames, renders and compares camera angles.

17
00:02:05,000 --> 00:02:15,000
A concept shot from the space you designed.

18
00:02:15,000 --> 00:02:25,000
Captured from the actual 3D scene.

19
00:02:25,000 --> 00:02:30,000
Adjust the angle. Make it yours.

20
00:02:30,000 --> 00:02:40,000
Download the concept shot and keep designing.

21
00:02:40,000 --> 00:02:50,000
Powered by Meta AI. Grounded in the actual 3D scene.

22
00:02:50,000 --> 00:02:56,000
A workspace for exhibitors, too.

23
00:02:56,000 --> 00:03:00,000
muvilion. From context to concept.
